    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d767">

                <pb facs="0889" n="793" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg793"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Russell to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-09-05"><hi rendition="#italic">September 5,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Conditions little more favorable for Government. Advisable have war vessel within
                    a few days’ call.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
